[[31,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>- Open the tailgate.</p><p><a href=\"#/194000940\">Op. 7015A04 TAILGATE INTERIOR PANEL - R+R</a></p><p>1. Working from the inside, undo the nut fixing the badge.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/194001500.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[31,1,0,"<p>- Remove the badge from the tailgate.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/194001501.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[31,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>- Place the badge on the tailgate.</p><p>- Working from the inside, tighten the nut fixing the badge.</p><p><a href=\"#/194000940\">Op. 7015A04 TAILGATE INTERIOR PANEL - R+R</a></p>"]]